---
title: Page Not Found
---
<%
@active = nil
@home = false
@dateline = ['Stop press', 'Page not found', 'Error 404']
%>
<div class="with-rail with-rail--404">
  <div>
    <p class="error-num">404</p>
    <h1 class="error-head">It looks like you are looking in the wrong bucket my friend&hellip;</h1>
    <p class="prose" style="max-width: 48ch;">The page moved, or it never existed. The archive goes back to <%= first_article_year %>, so there is a decent chance what you want is still here.</p>
    <div class="error-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">Back to the front page</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/archive/">Browse the archive</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <%= image_tag 'bucket.jpg', alt: '', style: 'width: 100%; height: 300px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 2px;' %>
  </figure>
</div>
